WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080
At the end of the Sui dynasty, the land was in great chaos and the people's lives were very hard.

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:12.998
In the villages everyone was anxious, all hoping for peace in the land.

00:00:13.348 --> 00:00:21.388
Li Yuan, aged fifty, was the commander guarding Taiyuan; wearing his armor, he resolved to rise in arms against Sui.

00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:27.426
He stood on the city wall, gazing into the distance, thinking for a long time.

00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:32.648
The soldiers raised their banners high and joined Li Yuan's ranks one after another.

00:00:32.998 --> 00:00:37.558
The ranks grew stronger day by day, and morale was very high.

00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:44.292
The great army set out southward, crossing high mountains in a mighty procession toward Chang'an.

00:00:44.642 --> 00:00:51.572
At daybreak, the gates of Chang'an opened, welcoming a brand-new era.

00:00:51.922 --> 00:00:59.746
The sun rose in the east and lit up Chang'an, and the history of the Tang dynasty unfolded from there.

